OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey prison governor John De
OL,4,ACarteret retiring
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Prison's governor John De
OL,7,FCarteret is set to retire from his
OL,8,Frole.
OL,10,FHe stepped aside from his role in April
OL,11,Fahead of an investigation into
OL,12,Fallegations about his conduct - the
OL,13,Fdetails of which have not been publicly
OL,14,Fannounced.
OL,16,FWhen he launched the investigation
OL,17,FBoley Smillie, chief executive of the
OL,18,FStates, said nobody should draw any
OL,19,Fconclusions from De Carteret's decision
OL,20,Fto stand aside while it was carried
OL,21,Fout.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
