OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey prison governor John De
OL,4,ACarteret retiring
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnnouncing his retirement Smillie said:
OL,7,F"Guernsey Prison is undoubtedly going
OL,8,Fthrough a challenging period and it is
OL,9,Fvery clear to me that improvements are
OL,10,Fneeded in a number of areas."
